        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The Employer shall provide a minimum of one hundred and fifty thousand dollars ($150,000.00) of additional life and dismemberment insurance coverage for employees whose duties during test flights are adjusting, recording, testing, and operating aircraft equipment in Employer-owned or operated aircraft and military aircraft.",
